            "profile_positions": [
              {
                "company": "Get2Hawaii",
                "description": "President and CEO of Get2Hawaii, a provider of leisure travel to dozens of consumer web sites, supplier web sites, affiliates, and travel agencies. Led the company from pre-release (inception) to the successful sale of hundreds of thousands of transactions and hundreds of millions of dollars of Hawaii inventory. \n\nGet2Hawaii technology is designed to broker inventory from a supplier to a retailer without the usual overhead associated with traditional wholesalers and manual operations. Get2's technology offers net rates, dynamic packaging, dynamic branding, full merchandising and promotional capabilities and full yield control.\n\nIn conjunction with its supply partners, Get2Hawaii offers net rates from hotels and resorts, all major air carriers, and a broad segment of car rental companies and activities.",
